            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"jeans_sizes = [\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"28\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest_size = jeans_sizes.min()\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Deve ser <code>min(jeans_sizes)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos salvar o menor valor em uma variável</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com o código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Deve ser <code>min(jeans_sizes)</code>.</p></body></html>",
