            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que isso exibe no console? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"light_intensity = [\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(light_intensity))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>60</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[200, 500, 60, 90]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O console abaixo mostra <code>60</code> para o código como está. O que ele exibiria se <code>60</code> fosse removido de <code>light_intensity</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"light_intensity = [\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(light_intensity))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>90</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>90</code>.</p></body></html>"
