          {
            "title": "Question: Ascending order",
            "id": 82734,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual será o primeiro número na lista após a ordenação?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"featured_articles = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"featured_articles.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(featured_articles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0, 1, 3, 5]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nenhum, já que o código de ordenação está errado</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Depois que a lista for ordenada, qual valor estará no índice <code>2</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"featured_articles = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"featured_articles.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(featured_articles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0, 1, 3, 5]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
