            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sort(active_users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Deve ser <code>active_users.sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com o código</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Podemos usar <code>sort()</code> apenas dentro de uma declaração <code>print()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Deve ser <code>active_users.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual substituição para a segunda linha ordena <code>active_users</code> do menor para o maior?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sort(active_users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>active_users.sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort(active_users)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>active_users = sort()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>active_users.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
