          {
            "title": "Question: Sorting strings",
            "id": 82737,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual nome aparecerá primeiro em <code>contacts</code> após a ordenação?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"contacts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"contacts.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(contacts)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 'Ava', 'Bill']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Ana\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Ava\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Bill\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Ana\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Ava\"</code> e <code>\"Ana\"</code> começam com <code>A</code>. Por que <code>sort()</code> coloca <code>\"Ana\"</code> primeiro?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"contacts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"contacts.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(contacts)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 'Ava', 'Bill']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A segunda letra, <code>n</code>, vem antes de <code>v</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort()</code> inverte a ordem em que os nomes foram escritos.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort()</code> coloca nomes mais curtos antes de nomes mais longos.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A segunda letra, <code>n</code>, vem antes de <code>v</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
