            "id": 82860,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Deveria ser <code>sum(cart)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos usar <code>sum()</code>, pois <code>cart</code> não é uma lista</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com o código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Deveria ser <code>sum(cart)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual substituição para a segunda linha faz o código exibir o total do carrinho, <code>87</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(sum(cart))</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(max(cart))</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(cart.sum())</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print(sum(cart))</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
